# Lanebreakers — read CLAUDE.md

The canonical, always-current project brief for AI agents is **`CLAUDE.md` at the
repo root**. Read it before making changes — it covers the architecture, the
golden rules (headless sim, one ruleset, layer boundaries), the netplay
protocol, the Ascendant Scepter system, expansion recipes, and which smoke tests
gate which changes.

Do not duplicate its content here. If anything in `CLAUDE.md` is stale, fix it
**there**, in the same commit as the code change — that file is loaded into
every fresh agent context (Claude Code auto-loads it; this rule exists so Cursor
agents read the same document).
